Z||000028||onfire||11-19-2001||01:43 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ken Wittlief:<BR><B>If the movie theaters want to make more money they should sell pizza or some reasonalble good food - then maybe people will go to the movies to eat and see a movie - or how about haveing a resturant at the movies?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>This place is awesome. Me and a few friends went. Spent like $50, and we couldn't finish all the food. They serve beer and wine too. Very cool. I must say that there sound system wasn't exactly THX quality, but the beer made up for it. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR> <A HREF="http://www.cinemagrill.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cinemagrill.com/</A> <P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/onfiresigtoo.jpg"> ||||reg||1
