g.  just simply stating that we get our beliefs from what it says.  you're right, if it were 'proof' it wouldn't be a religion.  belief and fact are two entirely different things.  i can't prove what i believe and i don't try, i just believe it.  i do understand what you're saying, but it's impossible to aviod flawed arguments when there is no solid proof to back up anything.||||reg||1
