Z||000709||TRiAD||12-12-2001||02:24 PM||||*turning back up the heat*<P>Ray, I'm truly sorry you think the only way to have fun is to do something wrong. You must be out killing people and stealing cars when you're not here, God knows you'd be bored otherwise...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Also, better to regret action than inaction? Huh...I wonder how many people who've met you in person regret not killing you with their bare hands...<P>...You should go tell them they should have done it, since they regret not doing it anyway...it's better ot regret what you DID, not what you did NOT do, remember?<P>I'm really sorry you feel this way, I'm enjoying myself here, but I'm really looking forward to meeting my Maker in person...although I'm not done with what He has me doing here yet, so I'm not in any hurry to "make" it happen. (that would defeat the entire purpose anyway)<P>I don't see how an eternity in worship of Him is boring...have you ever worshipped Christ? Have you ever felt His power? Have you ever been baptised in the Spirit?<P>You have no idea what you're missing...and for that, I feel for you....<BR>||||reg||1
